{"v":2,"catch":"一款垂直平台動作 Roguelike 遊戲，你可以利用劍在障礙物和敵人身上彈跳，並一路攀登高塔。","desc":"在這款垂直平台動作 Roguelike 遊戲中，一路攀登至高塔頂端吧！化身夢之騎士（Dream Knight），揮舞手中的劍，在敵人與障礙物上彈跳，向高塔頂端不斷前進。探索能為你的冒險提供強大助力的道具，並在每次挑戰之間解鎖永久升級與外觀裝飾。每次攀登高塔的體驗都將截然不同——遊戲會隨機選取精心手工打造的關卡、支線區域與道具，讓每次挑戰都充滿新鮮感。","publisher":"Sour Lemon Studios","release":"2026-09-17","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e9daf1a1fbac5115acc39f765bfea0bc8b9ac7efce34e0a4e896140bb44af161.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9abbcd48d362e6425040501e428a97d70917a1148eb8c42c64e45cd9f809d6ed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b90d80aa68d27fc80faf76563ce55cb78cccea7f74460a779678bdc0b19a671.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca9ce0741d7ac19d6aa425b90ed285205300c239c14283e5d2ccee138d73e3df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/602a9bad1f6a685e77341517d4a097df5fea7d2f44862161530be43c0a794cfc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cb6b4a7e58622f36370ec8b0074810895a9b8cac325f7d6c6bf6ce7387e804b9.jpg"],"titleId":"010049e01e5b2000"}